{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"日本名作家村上龍逝世　享年74歲　與村上春樹並稱「村上雙傑」\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/JP-RIP-261023-17.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】日本著名作家村上龍逝世，享年74歲。</p><p>村上龍與村上春樹並稱為「村上雙傑」，共同引領日本文壇。村上龍的作品，風格前衛及充滿感官衝擊，代表作包括《接近無限透明的藍》及《寄物櫃的嬰孩》。</p><p>村上龍亦曾經擔任電影導演及編劇，並積極就政經議題發聲，他本月17日在家中逝世，享年74歲。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:47.732629+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:28:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T18:38:41.548766+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:43.447147+00:00","content_hash":"0500542122f674bd06dfe69859e0b4fb27f8af4dd3416902aefd031a87ab6d7f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}